  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> DISABLED TEMPLATE. Before enabling, replace the activity.trigger value with an embedded Item/Activity reference that exists on this character (for example, Item.Counterspell.Activity.Cast, adjusted to the actual Activity name). The feature must be owned by the reactor; this generic template cannot point to a universal Activity UUID.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
